			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello honorable Five Rings members and officers.  I want to take this 
<br />
opportunity to introduce myself and to formally request that Elfa, a level 65 Storm 
<br />
Warden of Tunare, be considered to join 5R.  I believe that you will quickly 
<br />
see that I am a skilled druid who is always willing to help and will do what I 
<br />
can to be an asset to your most wonderful guild.
<br />
 
<br />
At this time, I am an officer of Sovereign Storm, recently noted as the 
<br />
largest family-style guild on the Luclin Server.  As an officer, I helped organize 
<br />
raids, lead raids, handle the healing strategy for the many mobs that we 
<br />
encountered, and make sure that people made it to and from our raids as efficiently 
<br />
as possible.  My dear friend Nognu, also an applicant to 5R and a very 
<br />
skilled wizard, organized and lead a successful Grummus raid, and I was honored to 
<br />
research the healing strategy and implement it.  I am a teacher in RL and know 
<br />
that there is always more to learn, and I look forward to the opportunity of 
<br />
learning from your skilled members what I can do to improve my skills as a 
<br />
druid.
<br />
 
<br />
A couple of personal and notable quests that I have recently completed are:  
<br />
The Marsinger Quest from the Plane of Hate and the Blessed Coldain Prayer 
<br />
Shawl.
<br />
 
<br />
In regards to flags/keys, I have completed the Trial by Execution for the 
<br />
PoV/PoS access, the Askr Quest for access to BoT, the Grummus kill for CoD 
<br />
access, the Wembly Quest for the alternate key for the Plane of Tactics, Enchanted 
<br />
Ring of Torden for the BoT Tower access, Xanamech kill for the PoI factory 
<br />
access, the PoN Hedge Quest, and a couple of spheres away from completing my 
<br />
Agnarr Key.
<br />
 
<br />
Elfa has 129 AA points spent in the following areas:
<br />
1.  Innate Wisdom 5/5
<br />
2.  Innate Run Speed 3/3
<br />
3.  Mental Clarity 3/3
<br />
4.  Spell Casting Mastery 1/3
<br />
5.  Spell Casting Reinforcement 1/3
<br />
6.  Mass Group Buff 1/1
<br />
7.  Dire Charm 1/1
<br />
8.  Enhanced Root 1/1
<br />
9.  Exodus 1/1
<br />
10.  Advanced Innate Wisdom 10/10
<br />
11.  Planar Power 5/5
<br />
12.  Innate Enlightenment 5/5
<br />
13.  Radiant Cure 1/3
<br />
14.  Spirit of the Wood 3/3
<br />
15.  Wrath of the Wild 3/3
<br />
16.  Persistent Casting 1/3
<br />
17.  Nature's Boon 3/5
<br />
 
<br />
In regards to spells, Elfa has almost every spell from level 1 to level 65, 
<br />
except for Winter's Frost (lvl 65 Ice DD spell), RGC (I can now purchase this 
<br />
with my LDoN points that I have accumulated), Ancient Line of Spells, and other 
<br />
LDoN spells (again, I can purchase these since I have approximately 7000+ 
<br />
LDoN points saved atm), the two LDoN spells I do have are Spirit of the Shrew and 
<br />
Pack Shrew.
<br />
 
<br />
My playing time is as follows:
<br />
Monday - Thursday:  5:00PM EST - 12:00AM EST
<br />
Friday:  5:00PM EST - FAAK
<br />
Saturday:  8:00AM EST - FAAK
<br />
Sunday:  8:00AM EST -12:00AM EST
<br />
Since I am a teacher, when summer arrives, I will also have the daytime hours 
<br />
to play on the weekdays.  
<br />
 
<br />
My computer system is: 1.67 GHz AMD Athlon XP Processor 2000+ with 512 MB 
<br />
DDR.  I have all the expansions enabled, including the latest GoD expansion.
<br />
 
<br />
Elfa is decently geared for not being in the Elemental Planes yet, and she 
<br />
has her FT maxed at 15.
<br />
 
<br />
I want to add that a good friend of mine, Nognu, is also applying to join 5R. 
<br />
 He is very creative and one of the finest wizards that I have had the 
<br />
opportunity to group with and serve with as co-officer of SS.  I would also like to 
<br />
note that I have been blessed to get to know Cinadien, a most wonderful wizard 
<br />
that I saw grow in skill and knowledge from his days out in front of Felwithe 
<br />
battling bats.
<br />
 
<br />
I hereby acknowledge having read the Mandatory Reading for Application thread 
<br />
in its entirety.
<br />
 
<br />
Magelo Profile Link:
<br />
 
<br />
<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=980003" target="_blank">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=980003</a>
<br />
 
<br />
Thank you again for you consideration of my application.</span><span class="postbody"><br />_________________<br /><pre>&#9484;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;<br> Zakalum<br> Prophet of Five Rings<br> "You betta bring it.  Wassup wit you?"<br>&#9492;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;</pre></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
